{#
  DC Fabric Part 3 - VTEP block in the underlay, spine role.
  Part 1's prefix-lists permit exact Lo0 /32s only. VTEP loopbacks
  (Loopback1) come from 10.255.1.0/24, so one range entry lets the
  spines accept and pass on every leaf VTEP. A new leaf touches no spine.
#}
ip prefix-list PL-UNDERLAY-IN
   seq 100 permit 10.255.1.0/24 ge 32
!
ip prefix-list PL-UNDERLAY-OUT
   seq 100 permit 10.255.1.0/24 ge 32
